This API has a problem - the caller now needs to know if the function is a local function or a function deployed to EDGE. This breaks the abstraction of a unified function executor.

Instead, lets add this GUID to FunctionDefinition:

```
type FunctionDefinition<I, O> = {
   meta?: {
        /** JSDoc here pls */
       edgeFunctionId?: string
   }

}

